CM_ "AUTOGENERATED FILE, DO NOT EDIT";

CM_ "daihatsu_granmax.dbc starts here";
CM_ "Daihatsu Gran Max (S403/S413) powertrain + chassis CAN";
CM_ "Base: perodua_psd_pt.dbc (Perodua Ativa). The Gran Max shares the";
CM_ "Daihatsu PSD CAN layer: 21 of that DBC's 23 car messages appear in a";
CM_ "153 s Gran Max highway capture (220676 frames, 69 IDs), and its signal";
CM_ "definitions decode to sane values on this car.";
CM_ "Frame checksum is the Toyota scheme, verified 100%% on 47 IDs.";
CM_ "MSG_xxx entries are IDs seen on the Gran Max that the Ativa DBC does";
CM_ "not cover - layout and CHECKSUM only, signals not decoded yet.";
CM_ "Scaling factors inherited from the Ativa are NOT calibrated for this";
CM_ "car. SPEED has been recalibrated to 0.01 (its raw value is identical";
CM_ "to BUTTONS.UI_SPEED on this car); the rest are still Ativa values.";
